1
00:00:01,067 --> 00:00:01,833
<i>He would not make a move on Joey
because he knows</i>

2
00:00:01,967 --> 00:00:03,467
<i>- I like her.
- Things change.</i>

3
00:00:03,600 --> 00:00:06,267
<i> [JIN HO SPEAKS IN KOREAN]</i>

4
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,533
<i>Let us talk tomorrow
when you are feeling better.</i>

5
00:00:08,667 --> 00:00:10,700
<i>We already ordered
a search for Jin's friend,</i>

6
00:00:10,833 --> 00:00:12,333
<i>but it looks like
they went underground.</i>

7
00:00:12,467 --> 00:00:14,133
<i> I do not need an explanation.</i>

8
00:00:14,267 --> 00:00:16,133
<i> I need results!</i>

9
00:00:16,267 --> 00:00:17,667
<i>I am sure he knows
where Jin Ho is,</i>

10
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:19,700
<i>but he will definitely not talk.</i>

11
00:00:19,833 --> 00:00:21,667
<i> We need to find Joey now.</i>

12
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,833
<i>Uncle, we are currently
following Jin Ho's friend.</i>

13
00:00:23,967 --> 00:00:25,233
<i>Where are you?
I will follow.</i>

14
00:00:25,367 --> 00:00:27,533
<i>I just need to take care
of a few things first,</i>

15
00:00:27,667 --> 00:00:29,367
<i>and then I will take you
back to your family.</i>

16
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,433
<i>- Really?
- Copy. We are on our way.</i>

17
00:00:31,567 --> 00:00:33,533
<i> Finish them.</i>

18
00:00:35,433 --> 00:00:37,700
<i> [OPENING THEME MUSIC]</i>

19
00:00:55,467 --> 00:00:56,900
This is it.

20
00:00:57,033 --> 00:00:58,333
[FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING]

21
00:00:58,467 --> 00:01:00,100
Let us just walk instead.

22
00:01:00,233 --> 00:01:01,533
They might sense something.

23
00:01:01,667 --> 00:01:03,333
[GUN COCKS]

24
00:01:03,467 --> 00:01:07,433
[FOREBODING MUSIC CONTINUES]

25
00:01:20,467 --> 00:01:22,833
[SPEAKING IN KOREAN]

26
00:01:22,967 --> 00:01:25,700
I used the secret path
at the back of the mountains.

27
00:01:25,833 --> 00:01:26,767
Okay, thank you, Bro.

28
00:01:26,900 --> 00:01:28,667
You are welcome.
Take care.

29
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:32,833
[FOREBODING MUSIC CONTINUES]

30
00:01:39,033 --> 00:01:41,200
There they are, it looks like
they are trying to escape.

31
00:01:41,367 --> 00:01:43,700
Finish them, Matias!

32
00:01:45,133 --> 00:01:49,267
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

33
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:58,633
[POLICE SIREN WAILING]

34
00:02:01,733 --> 00:02:03,300
Jin Ho...

35
00:02:05,367 --> 00:02:06,767
Kang Dae-Hyun!

36
00:02:06,900 --> 00:02:08,333
- You're under arrest!
- Dad!

37
00:02:08,467 --> 00:02:09,800
Take cover!

38
00:02:11,967 --> 00:02:13,033
Get down!

39
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,733
Get down!

40
00:02:14,867 --> 00:02:15,967
Dad, he did nothing wrong!

41
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:17,333
Take him!

42
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:19,733
- Jin Ho...
- Hands up!

43
00:02:19,867 --> 00:02:20,733
- It's okay, it's okay.
- Jin Ho...

44
00:02:20,867 --> 00:02:22,367
- I'm okay, I'm okay.
- No!

45
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:25,833
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

46
00:02:29,067 --> 00:02:31,033
Dad!
Dad!

47
00:02:31,167 --> 00:02:33,267
Do not arrest him!
He did nothing wrong!

48
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:36,600
Sir, Dad, please let him go!

49
00:02:36,733 --> 00:02:38,767
We are just doing our job, Joey.

50
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:40,300
- That is enough!
- Jin Ho!

51
00:02:40,433 --> 00:02:42,000
Joey, I'm okay.

52
00:02:42,133 --> 00:02:43,367
I'm really okay.

53
00:02:43,500 --> 00:02:44,967
Just listen to your father,
okay?

54
00:02:45,100 --> 00:02:46,467
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

55
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:48,300
What were you thinking?

56
00:02:48,467 --> 00:02:50,100
Why did you bring Joey with you?

57
00:02:50,233 --> 00:02:52,100
To use her as a hostage?

58
00:02:52,233 --> 00:02:54,800
Just make sure
that Joey is safe.

59
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,967
Let us talk.

60
00:02:58,100 --> 00:02:59,800
- Dad...
- Let's go.

61
00:03:00,233 --> 00:03:01,700
- Let us go now!
- What?

62
00:03:01,833 --> 00:03:03,267
We need to finish them!

63
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:04,633
Let's go!

64
00:03:04,767 --> 00:03:06,333
Let go of me!

65
00:03:06,467 --> 00:03:07,633
I will kill them all!

66
00:03:07,767 --> 00:03:09,167
Think carefully.

67
00:03:09,300 --> 00:03:11,500
Do not add more problems
to the group.

68
00:03:11,633 --> 00:03:13,167
What if we get tricked?

69
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:15,000
- Let's go!
- What is it now?

70
00:03:17,300 --> 00:03:20,900
You know, Joey,
that man cannot be trusted.

71
00:03:21,067 --> 00:03:21,933
He is dangerous!

72
00:03:22,067 --> 00:03:24,000
Dad, that is what I thought
at first too!

73
00:03:24,133 --> 00:03:25,600
But Jin Ho is truly a friend!

74
00:03:25,733 --> 00:03:26,700
What kind of friend?

75
00:03:26,833 --> 00:03:28,833
You do not even know
his real name.

76
00:03:29,433 --> 00:03:31,000
He is a dangerous man!

77
00:03:32,067 --> 00:03:34,533
Dad, if he were really
dangerous,

78
00:03:34,667 --> 00:03:37,100
why do I not have a single
bruise or wound from him?

79
00:03:37,867 --> 00:03:39,500
Major, I know Jin Ho.

80
00:03:39,633 --> 00:03:41,233
I am confident nothing bad
will happen

81
00:03:41,367 --> 00:03:42,867
to your child...

82
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:46,033
because Jin Ho
protects her closely.

83
00:03:46,167 --> 00:03:49,300
Of course, why would he
let Joey go?

84
00:03:49,867 --> 00:03:52,167
Joey is Jin Ho's ace.

85
00:03:52,300 --> 00:03:53,833
He planned all of these.

86
00:03:54,867 --> 00:03:56,400
That was not his plan.

87
00:03:56,533 --> 00:03:58,767
That was not Jin Ho's plan.

88
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:01,100
<i>You do not deserve to be here,
Joey.</i>

89
00:04:02,167 --> 00:04:04,133
<i> You should not be here.</i>

90
00:04:04,267 --> 00:04:07,567
<i>None of this should have
happened to you.</i>

91
00:04:08,300 --> 00:04:10,167
<i>You were just in the wrong place</i>

92
00:04:10,300 --> 00:04:11,833
<i> at the wrong time.</i>

93
00:04:12,767 --> 00:04:14,533
<i>I know I cannot turn back time,</i>

94
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:18,567
<i>but I know I can make
this right.</i>

95
00:04:19,333 --> 00:04:20,667
<i> Just trust me.</i>

96
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,867
His plan, Dad,

97
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:25,267
was to bring me home safely.

98
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:27,467
He just wanted to make sure
I got home safely.

99
00:04:27,633 --> 00:04:29,900
That was his plan, Dad.

100
00:04:30,033 --> 00:04:32,000
Please have mercy on our friend.

101
00:04:32,133 --> 00:04:33,300
Yes, Uncle Miguel,

102
00:04:33,433 --> 00:04:35,900
maybe you could let
our friend go.

103
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:38,333
You know he cannot do that.

104
00:04:38,467 --> 00:04:40,300
What kind of police officer
do you think

105
00:04:40,433 --> 00:04:42,333
Major Miguel Delgado is?

106
00:04:42,467 --> 00:04:44,200
He would never do that.
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

107
00:04:44,833 --> 00:04:46,267
Andrew is right.

108
00:04:47,067 --> 00:04:49,233
Let the law judge him...

109
00:04:50,233 --> 00:04:52,167
for what he has done.

110
00:04:54,700 --> 00:04:55,700
Let go of me!

111
00:04:55,833 --> 00:04:57,133
Why are you so angry?

112
00:04:57,267 --> 00:04:58,467
This is your fault, is it not?

113
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,900
Really.

114
00:05:00,033 --> 00:05:01,233
I was humiliated
in front of the whole group.

115
00:05:01,400 --> 00:05:02,767
I was humiliated
in front of Berdugo

116
00:05:02,900 --> 00:05:04,567
because of Jin Ho!

117
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:06,267
That is true, right?

118
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:08,633
You are already finished.

119
00:05:09,533 --> 00:05:10,700
Come on!

120
00:05:11,167 --> 00:05:12,667
- [GRUNTS]
- [THUDS]

121
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:15,933
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

122
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:19,000
Do not stop me!

123
00:05:19,133 --> 00:05:22,067
Do you want to be
the first to die?

124
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:26,300
When I say I will take revenge,

125
00:05:26,433 --> 00:05:27,667
this is how I do it!

126
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:30,133
Take him to the station now!

127
00:05:33,700 --> 00:05:37,733
[GUN FIRING]

128
00:05:38,667 --> 00:05:39,967
Cover!

129
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:42,567
[GUN FIRING]

130
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:45,633
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

131
00:05:45,767 --> 00:05:48,133
[GUN FIRING]

132
00:05:48,267 --> 00:05:52,567
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

133
00:05:53,867 --> 00:05:55,167
Let's go!

134
00:05:56,133 --> 00:05:57,900
[GUN FIRING]

135
00:05:58,033 --> 00:05:59,800
Let's go!

136
00:05:59,933 --> 00:06:01,100
Hurry!

137
00:06:01,233 --> 00:06:02,800
- [GUN FIRING]
- Let's go!

138
00:06:02,933 --> 00:06:05,033
Chase them!
Hurry!

139
00:06:08,600 --> 00:06:09,833
Who were they?

140
00:06:09,967 --> 00:06:11,267
Who else?

141
00:06:11,400 --> 00:06:12,967
Jin Ho's syndicate, of course.

142
00:06:13,667 --> 00:06:15,167
Jin Ho!

143
00:06:15,300 --> 00:06:17,667
Jin Ho! Your people
are coming to get you!

144
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:21,000
I do not think,
they are rescuing him.

145
00:06:21,733 --> 00:06:23,233
They want him dead.

146
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,100
I strongly feel

147
00:06:26,233 --> 00:06:27,767
that he is not the only target.

148
00:06:27,900 --> 00:06:29,400
We all are.

149
00:06:29,533 --> 00:06:33,500
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

150
00:06:41,133 --> 00:06:42,767
What do you think? Do you think
Jin Ho will go to prison?

151
00:06:42,900 --> 00:06:44,733
Will he be deported?

152
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,700
Honestly, I do not know,

153
00:06:48,833 --> 00:06:51,700
but I feel he will be detained.

154
00:06:51,833 --> 00:06:52,900
I feel sorry for him.

155
00:06:53,033 --> 00:06:54,800
I hope we can visit him.

156
00:06:54,933 --> 00:06:56,900
Sorry for him?
You feel sorry for him?

157
00:06:57,400 --> 00:06:59,033
But not for Joey?
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

158
00:06:59,167 --> 00:07:00,200
Joey said herself

159
00:07:00,333 --> 00:07:02,167
that he did nothing to her,
right?

160
00:07:02,300 --> 00:07:04,367
That came directly from her.

161
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:05,567
Wait, okay, whoa.

162
00:07:05,700 --> 00:07:07,300
Given that, fine.

163
00:07:07,433 --> 00:07:10,900
But according to the law,
he still did something wrong.

164
00:07:11,033 --> 00:07:13,000
When will you accept...

165
00:07:13,133 --> 00:07:15,767
that Jin Ho is part
of the syndicate?

166
00:07:17,700 --> 00:07:19,933
If he really is a syndicate
member,

167
00:07:20,067 --> 00:07:21,600
why do they want him dead?

168
00:07:25,167 --> 00:07:26,100
Hello, Matias?

169
00:07:26,233 --> 00:07:27,167
What happened?

170
00:07:27,300 --> 00:07:28,733
Liza would not stand down.

171
00:07:28,867 --> 00:07:29,933
She kept firing at Jin Ho

172
00:07:30,067 --> 00:07:31,800
even with many police around.

173
00:07:31,933 --> 00:07:34,467
Good thing we got out
before they reached us.

174
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,967
It looks like that woman
has lost all strategy.

175
00:07:37,100 --> 00:07:39,433
She is reckless
and not thinking anymore.

176
00:07:39,567 --> 00:07:41,333
That is exactly what I told you,
Berdugo.

177
00:07:41,467 --> 00:07:44,300
That is why her actions
need to be watched closely.

178
00:07:44,433 --> 00:07:45,967
You do that, Matias.

179
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:48,833
She is becoming a liability
to our group.

180
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,667
Make sure you know where she is

181
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:53,800
and what she is planning.

182
00:07:53,933 --> 00:07:55,200
Consider it done.

183
00:07:55,333 --> 00:07:58,000
But what if Liza makes
another wrong move?

184
00:07:58,700 --> 00:08:00,133
I will personally make sure

185
00:08:00,267 --> 00:08:02,333
she gets what she deserves.

186
00:08:09,767 --> 00:08:10,933
Mom!

187
00:08:11,067 --> 00:08:11,767
Joey?

188
00:08:11,900 --> 00:08:13,567
- Mom...
- Joey...

189
00:08:14,867 --> 00:08:17,900
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC PLAYING]

190
00:08:18,033 --> 00:08:18,933
How are you?

191
00:08:19,067 --> 00:08:20,167
You worried me so much.

192
00:08:20,300 --> 00:08:21,667
I was sick with worry about you.

193
00:08:21,833 --> 00:08:22,900
- What happened?
- I am sorry, Mom,

194
00:08:23,033 --> 00:08:24,600
but I am okay.

195
00:08:24,733 --> 00:08:26,833
What?
Even if you are okay,

196
00:08:26,967 --> 00:08:29,333
I am not happy
about what happened.

197
00:08:30,867 --> 00:08:32,333
I am sorry, Mom.

198
00:08:32,933 --> 00:08:34,800
What happened to the Korean man?

199
00:08:34,933 --> 00:08:36,667
Did he resist arrest?

200
00:08:36,800 --> 00:08:37,733
No, he did not.

201
00:08:37,867 --> 00:08:39,567
He is now in our custody.

202
00:08:40,933 --> 00:08:42,333
That is good.

203
00:08:42,467 --> 00:08:44,833
Thank God our child is safe.

204
00:08:45,667 --> 00:08:49,133
Joey, you are not leaving the
house for now, okay?

205
00:08:49,267 --> 00:08:50,833
[PENSIVE MUSIC PLAYING]
Absolutely not.

206
00:08:50,967 --> 00:08:52,967
When we arrested Jin Ho,

207
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:54,200
the syndicate came out

208
00:08:54,367 --> 00:08:55,800
and started shooting at us.

209
00:08:55,933 --> 00:08:57,967
- What?
- They wanted to kill us.

210
00:08:58,100 --> 00:08:59,133
I already spoke to the Chief,

211
00:08:59,267 --> 00:09:01,833
so security will be stationed
at the house.

212
00:09:02,567 --> 00:09:05,800
And you, Peter,
do not go home yet.

213
00:09:05,933 --> 00:09:08,533
We do not know what those
syndicates might do.

214
00:09:08,667 --> 00:09:09,700
All right.

215
00:09:09,833 --> 00:09:12,733
Joey and I will stay here
at the house to be safe.

216
00:09:14,333 --> 00:09:15,333
Oh...

217
00:09:15,467 --> 00:09:19,500
What will happen to Jin Ho?

218
00:09:19,633 --> 00:09:21,167
Will he go to jail?

219
00:09:21,867 --> 00:09:25,167
We can charge him with illegal
detention and kidnapping

220
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:26,900
because of what he did to Joey.

221
00:09:27,033 --> 00:09:30,333
Dad, I am not pressing charges.

222
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:33,033
He did not do
anything bad to me.

223
00:09:33,900 --> 00:09:36,633
Please, let us not
add more to his problems.

224
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:53,733
Joey said you understand
Tagalog.

225
00:09:53,867 --> 00:09:56,267
[CURIOUS MUSIC PLAYING]

226
00:09:56,400 --> 00:09:58,733
Yes, just a little.

227
00:10:00,900 --> 00:10:02,533
She also told me that...

228
00:10:03,500 --> 00:10:05,633
You saved her life

229
00:10:05,767 --> 00:10:07,367
and protected her.

230
00:10:07,500 --> 00:10:08,700
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

231
00:10:08,833 --> 00:10:11,533
That is why she asked me
not to charge you...

232
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:15,167
even though you kidnapped her.

233
00:10:16,733 --> 00:10:18,333
Do you know that kidnapping
is a heinous crime

234
00:10:18,467 --> 00:10:20,167
in the Philippines?

235
00:10:21,967 --> 00:10:25,200
The penalty is life
imprisonment.

236
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:31,200
So, is that what you are going
to charge me with?

237
00:10:31,333 --> 00:10:33,500
You should be grateful
my child is kind.

238
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:36,733
Even though you put her life
in danger

239
00:10:36,867 --> 00:10:38,667
and she almost died,

240
00:10:40,233 --> 00:10:42,133
she does not want to charge you.

241
00:10:44,833 --> 00:10:46,500
My child helped you.

242
00:10:47,633 --> 00:10:49,333
I hope you return the favor.

243
00:10:51,633 --> 00:10:53,167
What do you want?

244
00:10:55,633 --> 00:10:56,567
Tell me...

245
00:10:56,700 --> 00:10:59,133
where the syndicate is hiding.

246
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:02,333
Where are they?

247
00:11:02,467 --> 00:11:04,967
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

248
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:10,167
I'm sorry.

249
00:11:10,300 --> 00:11:11,900
I don't know.

250
00:11:12,033 --> 00:11:13,600
I know you have information.

251
00:11:13,733 --> 00:11:15,233
Do not lie anymore.

252
00:11:16,067 --> 00:11:18,833
I really have nothing to say.

253
00:11:18,967 --> 00:11:20,267
Why are you protecting

254
00:11:20,400 --> 00:11:22,367
the syndicate
that wants you dead?

255
00:11:22,500 --> 00:11:26,500
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

256
00:11:31,233 --> 00:11:33,467
My child said...

257
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:35,367
you are a good friend.

258
00:11:36,333 --> 00:11:38,600
You still have
a chance to change.

259
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:44,033
My child trusts you deeply.

260
00:11:45,033 --> 00:11:46,967
I hope you do not
break that trust.

261
00:11:47,100 --> 00:11:51,067
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

262
00:12:02,933 --> 00:12:06,367
[STIRRING MUSIC CONTINUES]

263
00:12:06,500 --> 00:12:08,867
Chief, just give me
a little more time.

264
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,667
Jin Ho will confess.

265
00:12:10,800 --> 00:12:11,967
But partner,

266
00:12:12,100 --> 00:12:15,000
it seems you used your child's
name a bit too much.

267
00:12:15,167 --> 00:12:17,167
That is exactly what Joey said.

268
00:12:17,300 --> 00:12:19,500
Well, it seems
to be effective on him.

269
00:12:19,633 --> 00:12:21,200
That is what I want to talk
about with you now,

270
00:12:21,333 --> 00:12:22,333
Major Delgado.

271
00:12:22,467 --> 00:12:24,967
He cannot stay here
at the station.

272
00:12:25,100 --> 00:12:28,433
The syndicate can easily
track him here.

273
00:12:28,567 --> 00:12:30,300
His life is at risk.
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

274
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,867
Then what do we do?

275
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:35,600
I have already coordinated
with our higher-ups,

276
00:12:35,733 --> 00:12:38,300
and they will provide support.

277
00:12:38,433 --> 00:12:40,800
There is a safe house
where Jin Ho

278
00:12:40,933 --> 00:12:42,967
can be moved until
we get the information

279
00:12:43,100 --> 00:12:44,900
we need from him about...

280
00:12:45,033 --> 00:12:47,000
the syndicate leader...

281
00:12:47,133 --> 00:12:50,167
and their network.

282
00:12:52,033 --> 00:12:53,433
Yes, Sir.

283
00:13:02,433 --> 00:13:06,600
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

284
00:13:11,033 --> 00:13:12,433
Liza!

285
00:13:14,267 --> 00:13:15,900
Where have you been this time?

286
00:13:17,833 --> 00:13:20,567
I was looking for a way
to find Jin Ho.

287
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:22,967
You know the police
already have him.

288
00:13:23,133 --> 00:13:25,733
And he is definitely
under heavy guard now.

289
00:13:25,867 --> 00:13:27,900
You know Berdugo is already
furious with you,

290
00:13:28,033 --> 00:13:30,167
and you are making things worse!

291
00:13:30,300 --> 00:13:33,867
That is why I am finding a way
to make up for it.

292
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:35,400
Make up for it?
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

293
00:13:35,533 --> 00:13:39,000
Given the size of your problem,
it will take time.

294
00:13:39,133 --> 00:13:40,967
And you still have a lot to do

295
00:13:41,100 --> 00:13:43,133
to erase your mistakes!

296
00:13:44,333 --> 00:13:46,000
So, all I can say is...

297
00:13:47,133 --> 00:13:49,333
good luck!

298
00:13:49,467 --> 00:13:51,033
Piece of advice...

299
00:13:51,667 --> 00:13:53,967
do not act on your own...

300
00:13:54,100 --> 00:13:56,667
because we have already proven

301
00:13:56,833 --> 00:13:58,900
how reckless you are!

302
00:13:59,033 --> 00:14:03,200
[TENSE MUSIC CONTINUES]

303
00:14:03,333 --> 00:14:04,133
Sis, I am sorry.

304
00:14:04,267 --> 00:14:05,400
I cannot make it
to your fundraiser.

305
00:14:05,533 --> 00:14:07,233
I am just really busy
with everything

306
00:14:07,367 --> 00:14:08,933
that happened to Joey.

307
00:14:10,100 --> 00:14:13,500
I understand, but please
be careful, okay?

308
00:14:13,633 --> 00:14:16,333
And tell Joey and the family
to be careful as well.

309
00:14:17,133 --> 00:14:19,067
Yes, Sis, I will.
Thank you.

310
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:20,700
Are you going to see Joey?

311
00:14:21,467 --> 00:14:23,567
She is Major Delgado's child,
right?

312
00:14:25,633 --> 00:14:26,900
Yes.

313
00:14:27,033 --> 00:14:28,433
[UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING]

314
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:31,167
If I were you,
I would not get involved.

315
00:14:31,300 --> 00:14:33,600
You might get dragged
into their mess.

316
00:14:34,700 --> 00:14:37,567
Tomas, I have been involved
for a long time.

317
00:14:37,700 --> 00:14:41,267
Since Major Miguel Delgado
was set up,

318
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:42,167
I have been part of this.

319
00:14:42,300 --> 00:14:44,033
I cannot turn my back now.

320
00:14:46,767 --> 00:14:49,033
You are being warned,
but you still refuse to listen.

321
00:14:49,167 --> 00:14:51,000
What is wrong with your brother?
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

322
00:14:51,133 --> 00:14:53,267
When will you
ever learn to listen?

323
00:14:53,400 --> 00:14:54,633
Tomas!

324
00:14:55,900 --> 00:14:57,700
And I am just doing
what is right.

325
00:14:58,333 --> 00:15:02,500
And I will not stop until that
criminal syndicate is gone.

326
00:15:02,667 --> 00:15:04,833
You have no idea
what they are capable of!

327
00:15:04,967 --> 00:15:07,067
If I were you,
I would be scared right now!

328
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,133
Why would I be scared?

329
00:15:09,267 --> 00:15:11,100
They are all just
a bunch of cowards,

330
00:15:11,233 --> 00:15:13,100
especially their leader,

331
00:15:13,233 --> 00:15:14,633
Berdugo.

332
00:15:14,767 --> 00:15:17,167
He cannot even
show himself to me.

333
00:15:17,300 --> 00:15:20,233
So why would I be
afraid of a coward?

334
00:15:20,367 --> 00:15:22,633
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

335
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:24,367
Stop it, please!

336
00:15:25,333 --> 00:15:27,200
This conversation
might go too far.

337
00:15:27,333 --> 00:15:29,367
It could even turn into a fight!
[TENSE MUSIC PLAYING]

338
00:15:30,367 --> 00:15:32,000
Your brother Tomas
is just reminding you

339
00:15:32,133 --> 00:15:34,233
because he is worried about you,

340
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:38,067
since the Delgados are clearly
being targeted right now.

341
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:42,200
That is exactly
what I am trying to say.

342
00:15:42,333 --> 00:15:43,600
Can you imagine?

343
00:15:43,733 --> 00:15:46,233
If I were the leader
of that syndicate,

344
00:15:46,367 --> 00:15:48,400
you would already be involved.

345
00:15:48,533 --> 00:15:50,967
I might even have you killed.

346
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:55,633
He has been trying to kill me
for a long time, Tomas.

347
00:15:55,767 --> 00:15:56,900
He already tried.

348
00:15:57,033 --> 00:15:59,267
What if your family
gets dragged into this?

349
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:01,200
And that is why I think...

350
00:16:01,333 --> 00:16:02,867
the only way to remove
that threat,

351
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,833
especially against Joey,

352
00:16:04,967 --> 00:16:08,433
is to eliminate everyone
in that syndicate,

353
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:10,333
especially Berdugo.

354
00:16:12,933 --> 00:16:15,167
Anyway, Sis, I have to go.

355
00:16:15,300 --> 00:16:19,067
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

356
00:16:20,333 --> 00:16:22,033
<i>You said that yourself, Andrew.</i>

357
00:16:22,167 --> 00:16:24,433
<i>Let us deal
with the consequences then.</i>

358
00:16:24,567 --> 00:16:28,533
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

359
00:16:30,367 --> 00:16:32,533
[GATE CREAKS]

360
00:16:40,033 --> 00:16:41,500
Zoey?

361
00:16:41,667 --> 00:16:45,700
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC PLAYING]

362
00:16:46,567 --> 00:16:48,967
I knew I would find you here.

363
00:16:49,100 --> 00:16:50,700
So, you are already out.

364
00:16:51,533 --> 00:16:53,500
Are you feeling better?

365
00:16:53,633 --> 00:16:54,967
It depends.

366
00:16:56,467 --> 00:16:58,233
How are you and Joey?

367
00:17:01,200 --> 00:17:02,900
Zoey, I am really sorry,

368
00:17:03,900 --> 00:17:06,533
but I need to be honest
with myself.

369
00:17:07,733 --> 00:17:09,700
Just answer me straight.

370
00:17:11,400 --> 00:17:13,233
Do you love her?

371
00:17:15,200 --> 00:17:16,667
Yes.

372
00:17:21,633 --> 00:17:24,267
That hurts more than
the bullet wound I got.

373
00:17:29,767 --> 00:17:31,633
Do not worry, Andrew.

374
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:34,767
That's all I need to hear.

375
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:39,467
At least you were honest
with me.

376
00:17:41,633 --> 00:17:43,433
Thank you for that.

377
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:51,700
Thank you as well
for understanding, Zoey.

378
00:17:52,967 --> 00:17:55,267
And I hope you...

379
00:17:56,133 --> 00:17:58,133
find the right person for you.

380
00:17:59,400 --> 00:18:01,567
Yes.

381
00:18:01,700 --> 00:18:04,033
Maybe in Valmora, but...

382
00:18:05,233 --> 00:18:07,133
Wait, you are going back
to Valmora?

383
00:18:07,867 --> 00:18:10,000
That is where I am from, Andrew.

384
00:18:11,300 --> 00:18:13,433
Good luck, Zoey.

385
00:18:13,567 --> 00:18:15,367
To you and Joey as well.

386
00:18:17,600 --> 00:18:20,300
Just remember, if you ever go up
north, you know what to do.

387
00:18:20,433 --> 00:18:23,233
Just message me, okay?

388
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:24,800
Okay.

389
00:18:25,533 --> 00:18:27,667
I will see you around.

390
00:18:31,667 --> 00:18:35,767
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC CONTINUES]

391
00:18:46,967 --> 00:18:50,567
[EMOTIONAL MUSIC CONTINUES]

392
00:18:53,300 --> 00:18:55,000
Have some coffee first.

393
00:18:57,067 --> 00:18:58,567
Oh.

394
00:18:58,700 --> 00:19:00,267
Clarissa, I need
to head out now.

395
00:19:00,400 --> 00:19:03,900
I still need to arrange
Jin Ho's relocation.

396
00:19:04,033 --> 00:19:07,733
There will be police guarding
you here anyway.

397
00:19:08,667 --> 00:19:09,600
Ah...

398
00:19:09,733 --> 00:19:12,233
All right, take care, okay?

399
00:19:12,367 --> 00:19:13,733
And hopefully...

400
00:19:13,867 --> 00:19:15,700
And hopefully he will confess.

401
00:19:16,667 --> 00:19:18,067
Hopefully.

402
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:19,267
If Jin Ho confesses

403
00:19:19,400 --> 00:19:21,733
about this syndicate

404
00:19:21,867 --> 00:19:23,667
and their location,

405
00:19:23,800 --> 00:19:26,000
all of this will finally end.
[GLUM MUSIC PLAYING]

406
00:19:27,233 --> 00:19:30,267
I do not think Jin Ho will talk.

407
00:19:31,867 --> 00:19:33,633
That is right, Uncle Miguel.

408
00:19:33,767 --> 00:19:36,133
It took us a long time
to earn his trust.

409
00:19:36,267 --> 00:19:39,933
Because he is used
to keeping secrets from us.

410
00:19:41,033 --> 00:19:44,467
Even if Jin Ho
hid his true identity,

411
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:46,567
I believe his friendship...

412
00:19:46,700 --> 00:19:48,367
was all real.

413
00:19:49,867 --> 00:19:50,800
I may have realized it late,

414
00:19:50,933 --> 00:19:53,500
but I believe he can be trusted.

415
00:19:53,633 --> 00:19:55,367
I just hope
we still get a chance

416
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:58,233
to show him that we are
the same way toward him.

417
00:19:58,367 --> 00:20:02,633
[GLUM MUSIC CONTINUES]

418
00:20:04,033 --> 00:20:07,900
[STIRRING MUSIC PLAYING]

419
00:20:10,733 --> 00:20:14,833
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC PLAYING]

420
00:20:24,167 --> 00:20:26,633
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

421
00:20:26,767 --> 00:20:30,300
[VEHICLES REVVING]

422
00:20:36,767 --> 00:20:40,833
[INQUISITIVE MUSIC CONTINUES]

423
00:20:48,967 --> 00:20:51,967
Chief, we are already
at the location.

424
00:20:53,033 --> 00:20:55,567
I will call again later,
my battery is low.

425
00:20:56,433 --> 00:20:57,733
Copy.

426
00:20:59,433 --> 00:21:01,867
Sweep the area
and take your positions.

427
00:21:02,000 --> 00:21:02,967
- Yes, Sir!
- Yes, Sir!

428
00:21:03,100 --> 00:21:04,600
Let's go.

429
00:21:08,200 --> 00:21:12,267
[BRAZEN MUSIC PLAYING♪]

430
00:21:40,033 --> 00:21:41,933
Why is this place so big?

431
00:21:42,633 --> 00:21:46,133
It is not just big,
it is also isolated.

432
00:21:46,267 --> 00:21:47,133
But do not worry.

433
00:21:47,267 --> 00:21:48,967
You are not alone here.

434
00:21:49,100 --> 00:21:50,933
I will stay with you.

435
00:21:51,067 --> 00:21:53,967
So, it is just you and me then?

436
00:21:55,100 --> 00:21:56,333
Oppa!

437
00:21:56,467 --> 00:21:57,433
Peter?

438
00:21:57,567 --> 00:21:58,833
Oppa!

439
00:21:58,967 --> 00:22:01,800
["NEVER SAY DIE" BY KIM DE LEON
PLAYING]

440
00:22:01,933 --> 00:22:03,333
Andrew...

441
00:22:05,700 --> 00:22:07,100
Joey...

442
00:22:09,367 --> 00:22:11,133
I'm so happy to see you.

443
00:22:12,433 --> 00:22:16,367
["NEVER SAY DIE" BY KIM DE LEON
PLAYING]

444
00:22:30,133 --> 00:22:32,900
What hole are you hiding in now,
Joey?

445
00:22:33,033 --> 00:22:34,367
The pests in our organization

446
00:22:34,500 --> 00:22:35,833
must be eliminated.

447
00:22:35,967 --> 00:22:37,167
Who are you referring to,
Berdugo?

448
00:22:37,300 --> 00:22:38,233
Everyone!

449
00:22:38,367 --> 00:22:39,500
What? You think I do not notice

450
00:22:39,633 --> 00:22:41,067
that you are targeting my child?

451
00:22:41,200 --> 00:22:43,900
All is fair in love and war.

452
00:22:44,033 --> 00:22:45,967
You traitor, Oppa!
Let the strongest survive!

453
00:22:46,100 --> 00:22:47,800
Come on!
[SHRIEKS]

454
00:22:47,933 --> 00:22:49,833
I am sure now about
how I feel for you.

455
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:51,200
We have one more problem.

456
00:22:51,333 --> 00:22:53,133
- What is it this time?
- I got you, Berdugo.
